     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, I am a student from University of Udine, and I have to show a presentation about irac<div>I&#39;m trying to execute the example about simulated Annealing Algorithms (SANN) (<a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/irace/irace.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/irace/irace.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482351291000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XX72W6PufuahNnw7jgGW8\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/irace/irace.pdf</a>) but there is a problem:<div>when I compile irace this error appear:</div><div><br></div><div>Error: == irace == The output of targetRunner must be a list</div><div>== irace == The output was:</div><div><br></div><div>== irace == This is not a bug in irace, but means that something failed in a call to the targetRunner or targetEvaluator functions provided by the user. Please check those functions carefully.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wRyR2-mjuj8/WHEhi1O3WBI/AAAAAAAAA7Q/P0ft5y1NIswDles6AAJkzzYGx9S2d76HgCLcB/s1600/targetrunner.PNG\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wRyR2-mjuj8/WHEhi1O3WBI/AAAAAAAAA7Q/P0ft5y1NIswDles6AAJkzzYGx9S2d76HgCLcB/s1600/targetrunner.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482351291000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36g15vmHc21x49CMQSgVBU\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wRyR2-mjuj8/WHEhi1O3WBI/AAAAAAAAA7Q/P0ft5y1NIswDles6AAJkzzYGx9S2d76HgCLcB/s400/targetrunner.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"171\"></a><br><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-tL5ufphTo_A/WHEh_16MuyI/AAAAAAAAA7U/svt3mtpq2xwNU6jdZMDc-HKu9QJLwFXlQCLcB/s1600/result.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-tL5ufphTo_A/WHEh_16MuyI/AAAAAAAAA7U/svt3mtpq2xwNU6jdZMDc-HKu9QJLwFXlQCLcB/s1600/result.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482351291000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1yLOHMeXESyPrvCU-0okCU\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-tL5ufphTo_A/WHEh_16MuyI/AAAAAAAAA7U/svt3mtpq2xwNU6jdZMDc-HKu9QJLwFXlQCLcB/s1600/result.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>How can I solve it?<br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Marco</div></div></div>"
