     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello Marco, <div><br></div><div>We have changed the version of irace, and the output of the target runner function must be now a list containing the elements &quot;cost&quot; and &quot;time&quot; (time only when needed).</div><div><br></div><div>For the SA example you just have to return the list:</div><div> <br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">target</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">runner </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">experiment</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scenario</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  instance </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> experiment$instance<br>  configuration </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> experiment$configuration<br>  D </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  par </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> runif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  fn </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    weight </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> instance<br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">weight </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> f_rastrigin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> weight</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> f_rosenbrock</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  res </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> optim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">par</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fn</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> method</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;SANN&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> control</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">maxit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tmax </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">configuration</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tmax&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> temp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">configuration</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;temp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  result </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cost</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">res$value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">result</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>I hope this solves your problems, let us know if you have any other issue!</div><div>Good luck with the presentation!</div><div><br></div><div>Leslie. </div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><br></div>On Sunday, 8 January 2017 01:35:45 UTC+1, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marcodel...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, I am a student from University of Udine, and I have to show a presentation about irac<div>I&#39;m trying to execute the example about simulated Annealing Algorithms (SANN) (<a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/irace/irace.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/irace/irace.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482351295000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3dzd7O7jWLynRinCsDNfra\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/irace/irace.pdf</a>) but there is a problem:<div>when I compile irace this error appear:</div><div><br></div><div>Error: == irace == The output of targetRunner must be a list</div><div>== irace == The output was:</div><div><br></div><div>== irace == This is not a bug in irace, but means that something failed in a call to the targetRunner or targetEvaluator functions provided by the user. Please check those functions carefully.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wRyR2-mjuj8/WHEhi1O3WBI/AAAAAAAAA7Q/P0ft5y1NIswDles6AAJkzzYGx9S2d76HgCLcB/s1600/targetrunner.PNG\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wRyR2-mjuj8/WHEhi1O3WBI/AAAAAAAAA7Q/P0ft5y1NIswDles6AAJkzzYGx9S2d76HgCLcB/s1600/targetrunner.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482351295000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KnVKunDHrm9fNyAwwAlpY\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wRyR2-mjuj8/WHEhi1O3WBI/AAAAAAAAA7Q/P0ft5y1NIswDles6AAJkzzYGx9S2d76HgCLcB/s400/targetrunner.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\